GEODATABASE_FILE_5_PRESERVE_GLOBALID "$(GEODATABASE_FILE_OUT_PRESERVE_GLOBALID_GEODATABASE_FILE_5)"
GUI CHOICE GEODATABASE_FILE_OUT_PRESERVE_GLOBALID_GEODATABASE_FILE_5 yes%no Preserve GlobalID:
# ============================================================================
# Enable Load Only Mode when inserting features. This will disable updating of the spatial index
# while data is loading, and rebuild the index after writing is done.
