GEODATABASE_FILE_5_RELATIONSHIP_WRITE_OVERRIDE "$(GEODATABASE_FILE_OUT_RELATIONSHIP_WRITE_OVERRIDE_GEODATABASE_FILE_5)"
GUI CHOICE GEODATABASE_FILE_OUT_RELATIONSHIP_WRITE_OVERRIDE_GEODATABASE_FILE_5 yes%no Override Relationship Writing:
